      "check": "Viewed at 1x and 3x nearest on #172336, every frame's intended exterior shows the panel with no unintended opaque canvas matte, tile, halo or fringe. A deliberate backing shape is permitted if part of the recorded subject design with transparent exterior. Partial alpha and selective intentional anti-aliasing are permitted; binary alpha is not required. RGB values where alpha is zero are insignificant. This visual record decides transparency appearance; measured alpha/component flags do not reject artwork.",
      "domain": "visual",
      "mode": "visual",
      "status": "unperformed",
